omnibridge (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian and Ubuntu packaging.
  * Two binary packages: omnibridge (daemon, CLI, systemd user unit, hicolor
    icon) and omnibridge-gui (desktop application, .desktop entry, D-Bus
    activation entry, AppStream metadata).
  * The systemd user unit is the same file the RPM installs, from
    packaging/common/. It ships disabled on both formats.
  * No firewall metadata: Debian enables no firewall by default and Ubuntu
    ships ufw inactive, so a firewalld XML would be dead weight on nearly
    every install. Audit 9.3.
  * No maintainer script touches ~/.local/share/omnibridge, on any path,
    including purge.

 -- Yuri Converso Sismotto <yuri.sismotto@gmail.com>  Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
